abstract: "Manuscripts, formal proofs, and exact computational certificates from fully autonomous agentic research generated by AI systems. The initial research and proofs were generated autonomously by GPT 6 with Pro Reasoning in ChatGPT. GPT 6 Astra in Codex autonomously produced the formalizations and corrections. The authors checked the proofs to the best of their mathematical abilities. This check is not expert validation or peer review. Dev D. Goyal is responsible for publication. Each paper states its proof scope and provides its own citation."
